    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040670/extras/5390beefa4250eb40d9b86fb7ac2beb9.avif?t=1746352906\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalina's Horror Adventure is a 2D pixel art horror game.\u00a0Explore the terrifying dimension of The World, shoot things, talk to its peculiar inhabitants and solve the mysteries behind this dark world and its protagonist.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040670/extras/5390beefa4250eb40d9b86fb7ac2beb9.avif?t=1746352906\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalina's Horror Adventure is a 2D pixel art horror game.\u00a0Explore the terrifying dimension of The World, shoot things, talk to its peculiar inhabitants and solve the mysteries behind this dark world and its protagonist.</p>",
